reagent-desc-graft-cells = Living cells in the blood. A centrifuge extracts species particles from them.
reagent-desc-graft-particles = Extracted species particles. Mix with another species' particles and unstable mutagen.
reagent-desc-graft-mutagen = Prepares the body for a foreign limb. Inject during the graft or right after.
reagent-effect-guidebook-graft-spoil = { $chance ->
        [1] Spoils
       *[other] has a { NATURALPERCENT($chance, 2) } chance to spoil
    } the mutagen into a strong poison

